            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1、因果系统：ROC为某直线的右侧，即 \\( h(t) \\) 是 \\( u(t) \\) 型；",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.146,
                0.435,
                0.163
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2、稳定系统：ROC内包含虚轴；",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.174,
                0.73,
                0.192
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1)若 \\( H(s) \\) 分母多项式为一阶或者二阶—求极点，然后看极点位置",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.144,
                0.205,
                0.734,
                0.239
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 22:  \\( H(s)=\\frac{1}{s^{2}+3s+2-k} \\)  若系统稳定，求常数 k 应满足的条件？",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.45,
                0.262,
                0.468
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(3)罗斯矩阵",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "bbox": [
                0.391,
                0.478,
                0.605,
                0.642
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.309,
                0.671,
                0.686,
                0.716
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\mathsf {c} _ {n - 1} = \\frac {- 1}{a _ {n - 1}} \\left| \\begin{array}{c c} a _ {n} & a _ {n - 2} \\\\ a _ {n - 1} & a _ {n - 3} \\end{array} \\right|,   \\mathsf {c} _ {n - 3} = \\frac {- 1}{a _ {n - 1}} \\left| \\begin{array}{c c} a _ {n} & a _ {n - 4} \\\\ a _ {n - 1} & a _ {n - 5} \\end{array} \\right|... \\tag {1.1}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.31,
                0.722,
                0.687,
                0.765
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\mathrm{d} _ {n - 1} = \\frac {- 1}{c _ {n - 1}} \\left| \\begin{array}{c c} a _ {n - 1} & a _ {n - 3} \\\\ c _ {n - 1} & c _ {n - 3} \\end{array} \\right|, \\mathrm{d} _ {n - 3} = \\frac {- 1}{a _ {n - 1}} \\left| \\begin{array}{c c} a _ {n - 1} & a _ {n - 5} \\\\ c _ {n - 1} & c _ {n - 5} \\end{array} \\right|...\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.811,
                0.477,
                0.828
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "以此类推，把第一列数值全部算出来",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.838,
                0.478,
                0.856
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "稳定的充要条件：第一列全部为正数",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.866,
                0.698,
                0.884
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "若第一列系数符号不同，符号改变次数是极点在右半平面个数",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.894,
                0.607,
                0.912
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "若 \\( H(s) \\) 为二阶多项式 \\( s^{2}+\\alpha s+\\beta \\) ，只需 \\( \\alpha>0,\\beta>0 \\) .",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
