            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例25：判断系统 \\(H(s) = \\frac{s}{(s + 1)(s + 2)}\\) 的滤波特性。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.485,
                0.328,
                0.503
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "6、可逆系统的求解",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.337,
                0.511,
                0.669,
                0.662
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} & \\xrightarrow {f (t)} \\xrightarrow {h _ {1} (t)} \\xrightarrow {y (t)} \\xrightarrow {h _ {2} (t)} \\xrightarrow {f (t)} \\\\ & \\quad \\text {原系统} \\quad \\text {逆系统} \\\\ & \\quad y (t) = f (t) * h _ {1} (t) \\\\ & \\quad f (t) = y (t) * h _ {2} (t) \\\\ & \\quad f (t) = f (t) * h _ {1} (t) * h _ {2} (t) \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.668,
                0.24,
                0.684
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\(\\Rightarrow\\) 总系统：",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.378,
                0.695,
                0.619,
                0.738
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{c} h (t) = h _ {1} (t) * h _ {2} (t) = \\delta (t) \\\\ \\Rightarrow H _ {1} (s) \\cdot H _ {2} (s) = 1 \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.746,
                0.646,
                0.763
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "即逆系统的系统函数可用原系统的系统函数求倒数获得。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
